      btn_text: "Send an Enquiry via Typeform"
      new_tab: true
      icon: "/img/svg/pixel-cellular-signal-1.svg"
    - title: "Virtual Sales Training"
      text: "Put your team through our 6-month program (payment plans available) packed with coaching/training and includes our Rebel outbound/ prospecting tools, created by us and shipped to their door for execution! Set more meetings, win more sales."
      btn_link: "/squadron/"
      btn_text: "Click Here to Learn More"
      new_tab: false
      icon: "/img/svg/pixel-cellular-signal-2.svg"
    - title: "Customize Your Training"
      text: "Not feeling the first two option? No worries, you can customize a Rebellion for yourself as a leader or your team of individual sellers, BDRs, SDRs, account executives, whatever title they hold! Just click below and get to planning."
